From: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 21 Mar 2024 19:10:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0873/1695] product/optee-stm32mp2: create stm32 power domain
 module driver

Create a new module driver named mod_stm32_pd, which can handle power
domain actions on stm32mp2 product.
One mod_stm32_pd element per power domain.
One mod_power_domain element per power domain
Only one mod_scmi_power_domain element at all.

Right now stm32_pd is "empty", callback for specific power domains will
be add later.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 7ea147472859fbaa7300eeba294da051b47784fa product/optee-stm32mp2: create stm32 power domain module driver]
